  "description": "Syncfusion® ASP.NET MVC In-Place Editor control enables inline editing of content directly within the page without navigating away or opening a separate dialog. It supports a wide range of editor types including TextBox, Numeric, DatePicker, DropDownList, MultiSelect, RichTextEditor, and more. It provides features like edit on click/double-click, validation, server-side data saving, custom adaptor support, and accessibility, making it ideal for detail pages and data record views in ASP.NET MVC applications.",
